message: "If you use the TAS workbench, cite this software and distinguish it from the supplied AMENRA S-DMT concept documents."
title: "TAS: Topological Acoustic Stylus Research Workbench"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-06
authors:
  - family-names: Slade
    given-names: Trent
