abstract: >-
  An offline deterministic acoustic-field simulator and evidence-audit
  workbench that translates the Topological Acoustic Stylus proposal into
  explicit phased-array equations, testable proxies, reproducible exports,
  and a non-clinical safety boundary.
keywords:
  - ultrasound
  - phased array
  - acoustic field
  - sonification
  - reproducible simulation
  - hypothesis audit

